  "example": {
   "problem": "Tiles make a plus sign. Figure 1 has 5 tiles and figure 2 has 9 tiles. Figure 3 has arms of 3 tiles. How many tiles are in figure 10? Which figure has 81 tiles?",
   "steps": [
    "Each figure has 4 arms and 1 middle tile. In figure n each arm has n tiles.",
    "Rule: tiles = 4 × figure number + 1.",
    "Figure 10: 4 × 10 + 1 = 41 tiles.",
    "Backwards: 81 - 1 = 80, and 80 ÷ 4 = 20. Figure 20 has 81 tiles."
   ],
